OL,3,GNEWSAMan held after woman, 80, dies in
OL,4,Athree-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after an
OL,7,F80-year-old woman died in a crash
OL,8,Finvolving two cars and a tractor.
OL,10,FThe crash happened on the A267 near
OL,11,FMark Cross, East Sussex, on Sunday, at
OL,12,Fabout 15:15 GMT.
OL,14,FThe woman, from Frant, was travelling
OL,15,Fin a black Volvo which was involved in
OL,16,Fa crash with a black Porsche and a
OL,17,Ftractor.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
