OL,3,GNEWSAMan held after woman, 80, dies in
OL,4,Athree-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 61-year-old man from Bromley,
OL,7,Fsouth-east London, who was driving the
OL,8,FPorsche, has been arrested on suspicion
OL,9,Fof causing death by dangerous driving
OL,10,Fand remains in custody, Sussex Police
OL,11,Fsaid.
